 "summary": "Seven single ultrafast-recovery rectifier diodes in the two-terminal DO-214AC (SMA) molded package. All carry 1.0 A average forward current and 30 A surge; they differ in reverse voltage, from 50 V (US1A) to 1000 V (US1M), and with it in forward drop (1.0, 1.30 or 1.70 V max at 1.0 A) and recovery time (50 or 75 ns max). US1M is the 1000 V type, with 1.70 V max forward drop and 75 ns max reverse recovery.",
